      },
      "lineNbr": 144,
      "author": {
        "id": 1086611
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-12-22T21:05:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s a valid concern. WifiSupplicantControl#removeDoubleQuotes achieves the same as ScanResultUtil#getUnquotedSSID. Let\u0027s consolidate them.",
      "parentUuid": "d7c9e645_6eff86b6",
